<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against the dollar and strengthened against the pound on Friday in line with international trends, commercial bank foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a commercial bank mean rate of 20.5815 to the dollar from 20.5695 on Wednesday. The rupee was posted at a mean rate of 33.4835 to the pound from 33.593 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Clifford Vellien ++230  211-9555</p>
</text>
